  "id": "MAL-2026-18860",
  "summary": "Malicious code in @kyynotdevv/baileys (npm)",
  "details": "@kyynotdevv/baileys is a fork of the Baileys WhatsApp Web library that silently subscribes the installer's own WhatsApp account to WhatsApp Channels chosen by the publisher. When the socket connects, code in lib/Socket/newsletter.js sends the WhatsApp w:mex FOLLOW query for the channel ID(s) 120363405751989725@newsletter, 120363407393907794@newsletter, 120363409815577276@newsletter, 120363424433029723@newsletter, using the victim's authenticated session and without telling them. Same behaviour as the PhantomSub family (MAL-2026-17342).",
